<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30073> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has caster agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30073> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to an agent who is responsible for creating a manifestation by pouring a liquid or molten substance into a mold and leaving it to solidify to take the shape of the mold."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30073> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30073> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10007> .
