<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30070> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to an agent who is responsible for creating a manifestation by cutting letters, figures, or other marks on a surface such as a wooden or metal plate used for printing."@en .
