<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "data di manifattura"@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Arco di tempo associato alla stampa, duplicazione, fusione, etc., di una manifestazione pubblicata."@it .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ražošanas datējums"@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sasaista manifestāciju ar laikposmu, kas ir saistīts ar publicētas manifestācijas iespiešanu, tiražēšanu, u.tml."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "ražošanas datējums"@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Laikposms, kas ir saistīts ar publicētas manifestācijas iespiešanu, tiražēšanu, u.tml."@lv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "有生产日期"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "将一种载体表现与出版载体表现的印刷、复制、铸造或其他生产方式的时间段关联起来。"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "生产日期"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "出版载体表现的印刷、复制、铸造或其他生产方式的时间段"@zh-Hans-CN .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "imalat tarihi ile ilişkilidir"@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Bir gösterimi, yayınlanan bir gösterimin yazdırıldığı, çoğaltıldığı, döküldüğü, döküldüğü veya başka bir şekilde üretildiği bir zaman aralığıyla ilişkilendirir."@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "üretim tarihi"@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Yayınlanan bir gösterimin basıldığı, çoğaltıldığı, döküldüğü veya başka bir şekilde üretildiği bir zaman aralığı."@tr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tiene fecha de fabricación"@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaciona una manifestación con un espacio de tiempo durante el cual una manifestación publicada es impresa, duplicada, fundida o de otra manera producida."@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "má datum výroby"@cs .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Vztahuje provedení k časovému vymezení, během něhož je zveřejněné provedení vytištěno, rozmnoženo, odlito nebo jinak vyrobeno."@cs .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "datum výroby"@cs .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Časové vymezení, během něhož je zveřejněné provedení vytištěno, rozmnoženo, odlito nebo jinak vyrobeno."@cs .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ist Herstellungsdatum"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Setzt eine Manifestation in Beziehung zu einem Zeitraum, in dem eine veröffentlichte Manifestation gedruckt, vervielfältigt, gegossen oder anderweitig hergestellt wird."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "Herstellungsdatum von"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Ein Zeitraum, in dem eine veröffentlichte Manifestation gedruckt, vervielfältigt, gegossen oder anderweitig hergestellt wird."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/hasSubproperty> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/datatype/P30010> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30010> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/hasSubproperty> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/object/P30010> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has manufacture statement"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to a statement that identifies a place of manufacture, a manufacturer, or a date of manufacture of a published manifestation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10007> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/manufactureStatement.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A manufacture statement includes a statement about the printing, duplicating, casting, or other method of manufacturing of a published manifestation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "manufacture statement"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A statement that identifies a place of manufacture, a manufacturer, or a date of manufacture of a published manifestation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "a pour mention de fabrication"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Met une manifestation en relation avec une mention qui identifie un lieu de fabrication, un fabricant ou une date de fabrication d’une manifestation publiée."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Une mention de fabrication comprend une mention relative à l’impression, à la reproduction, au moulage ou à toute autre méthode de fabrication d’une manifestation publiée."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "mention de fabrication"@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Mention qui identifie un lieu de fabrication, un fabricant ou une date de fabrication d’une manifestation publiée."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "declaración de fabricación"@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Una declaración que identifica un lugar de fabricación, un fabricante o una fecha de fabricación de una manifestación publicada."@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har tillverkningsuppgift"@sv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "tillverkningsuppgift"@sv .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "vervaardigingsvermelding"@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Een vermelding die een plaats van vervaardiging, een vervaardiger of datum van vervaardiging identificeert van een gepubliceerde manifestatie."@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "có thông tin chế tạo"@vi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Liên kết biểu thị với thông tin nhận dạng địa điểm hoặc các địa điểm chế tạo, nhà chế tạo hoặc các nhà chế tạo, và ngày hoặc các ngày chế tạo của biểu thị dưới hình thái xuất bản."@vi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Thông tin chế tạo bao gồm thông tin liên quan tới in, nhân sao, đúc, v.v..., của biểu thị dưới hình thái xuất bản."@vi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "thông tin chế tạo"@vi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Thông tin nhận dạng địa điểm hoặc các địa điểm chế tạo, nhà chế tạo hoặc các nhà chế tạo, và ngày hoặc các ngày chế tạo của biểu thị dưới hình thái xuất bản."@vi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Een vervaardigingsvermelding omvat een vermelding met betrekking tot het drukken, reproduceren, gieten of andere methode van het vervaardigen van een gepubliceerde manifestatie."@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har fremstillingsoplysning"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en manifestation til en oplysning, som identificerer fremstillingssted- eller steder, producent eller producenter, og dato- eller datoer for fremstilling af en publiceret manifestation."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Fremstillingsoplysning omfatter en oplysning, som relaterer til trykning, duplikering, casting etc. af en publiceret manifestation."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "fremstillingsoplysning"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Oplysning, som identificerer fremstillingssted, producent eller producenter, og dato- eller datoer for fremstilling af en publiceret manifestation."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hat Herstellungsangabe"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Setzt eine Manifestation in Beziehung zu einer Angabe, die einen Herstellungsort, einen Hersteller oder ein Herstellungsdatum einer veröffentlichten Manifestation identifiziert."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Darunter fallen Angaben zum Druck, zur Vervielfältigung, zum Guss oder einer anderen Herstellungsmethode einer veröffentlichten Manifestation."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "Herstellungsangabe"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Eine Angabe, die einen Herstellungsort, einen Hersteller oder ein Herstellungsdatum einer veröffentlichten Manifestation identifiziert."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "té com a menció de fabricació"@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaciona una manifestació amb una menció que identifica un lloc de fabricació, un fabricant o una data de fabricació d’una manifestació publicada."@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Una menció de fabricació inclou una menció sobre la impressió, la reproducció, el modelat o un altre mètode de fabricació d’una manifestació publicada."@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "menció de fabricació"@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Menció que identifica un lloc de fabricació, un fabricant o una data de fabricació d’una manifestació publicada."@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Liittää manifestaation merkintöön, joka identifioi julkaistun manifestaation valmistuspaikan, valmistajan tai valmistusajan."@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "valmistusmerkintö"@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Merkintö, joka identifioi julkaistun manifestaation valmistuspaikan, valmistajan tai valmistusajan."@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "framstillingsangivelse"@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "En angivelse som identifiserer et sted eller steder for framstilling, tilvirker eller tilvirkere og dato eller datoer for framstilling av en publisert manifestasjon."@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "έχει μνεία κατασκευής"@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Συνδέει μια εκδήλωση με μια μνεία που ταυτίζει έναν τόπο ή τόπους κατασκευής, έναν κατασκευαστή ή κατασκευαστές και μια χρονολογία ή χρονολογίες κατασκευής μιας εκδήλωσης σε μια δημοσιευμένη μορφή."@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Οι μνείες κατασκευής περιλαμβάνουν μνείες σχετικές με την εκτύπωση, την αντιγραφή, τη χύτευση κ.λπ. μιας εκδήλωσης σε μια δημοσιευμένη μορφή."@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "μνεία κατασκευής"@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Μια μνεία που ταυτίζει έναν τόπο ή τόπους κατασκευής, έναν κατασκευαστή ή κατασκευαστές και μια χρονολογία ή χρονολογίες κατασκευής μιας εκδήλωσης σε μια δημοσιευμένη μορφή."@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/hasElementType> "6" .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "gyártási közlése a következő:"@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Hozzákapcsol egy megjelenési formát egy közléshez, amely azonosítja egy kiadott megjelenési forma gyártási helyét, gyártóját és a gyártás időpontját."@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A gyártási közlések olyan közléseket tartalmaznak, amelyek egy kiadott megjelenési forma nyomtatására, sokszorosítására, öntésére, stb. vonatkoznak."@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "gyártási közlése:"@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Egy közlés, amely azonosítja egy kiadott megjelenési forma gyártási helyét, gyártóját és a gyártás időpontját."@hu .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Valmistusmerkintö sisältää julkaistun manifestaation painamiseen, monistamiseen, kirjasinten valamiseen tms. liittyvän merkinnön."@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/instructionNumber> "2.1" .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "valmistusmerkintö"@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har framstillingsangivelse"@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en manifestasjon til en angivelse som identifiserer et sted eller steder for framstilling, tilvirker eller tilvirkere og dato eller datoer for framstilling av en publisert manifestasjon."@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "En framstillingsangivelse inkluderer angivelse knyttet til trykking, kopiering, rollebesettelse etc. for en publisert manifestasjon."@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heeft vervaardigingsvermelding"@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relateert een manifestatie aan een vermelding die een plaats van vervaardiging, een vervaardiger of een datum van vervaardiging identificeert van een gepubliceerde manifestatie."@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "له بيان تصنيع"@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "يربط بين تجسيدة وبيان يحدد مكان أو أماكن تصنيع، ومصنع أو مصنعون، وتاريخ أو تواريخ تصنيع خاص بتجسيدة منشورة."@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "يشمل بيان الصناعة البيان المرتبط بالطباعة، أو النسخ، أو الصب، إلخ. لتجسيدة منشورة."@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "بيان تصنيع"@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "بيان يحدد مكان أو أماكن تصنيع، ومصنع أو مصنعون، وتاريخ أو تواريخ تصنيع خاص بتجسيدة منشورة."@ar .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "valmistamisandmed"@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Seostab kehastuse andmetega, mis identifitseerivad avaldatud kehastuse valmistamiskoha(d), valmistaja(d) ja valmistamisaja(d)."@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Valmistamisandmed hõlmavad andmeid, mis on seotud avaldatud kehastuse trükkimisega, paljundamisega, valamisega vms."@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "valmistamisandmed"@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Andmed, mis identifitseerivad avaldatud kehastuse valmistamiskoha(d), valmistaja(d) ja valmistamisaja(d)."@et .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30109> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ha come formulazione di manifattura"@it .
