<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to a categorization reflecting the format of the storage medium and housing of a carrier in combination with the type of intermediation device required to view, play, run, or otherwise access the content of a manifestation."@en .
