<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30082> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has manufacturer agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to an agent who is responsible for printing, duplicating, casting, or other method of manufacturing a published manifestation."@en .
