<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Een werk dat is een korte evaluatie van een manifestatie."@nl .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "được tổng quan trong (biểu thị)"@vi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Liên kết biểu thị với tác phẩm có chứa đánh giá vắn tắt về biểu thị đang được mô tả."@vi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "được tổng quan trong (biểu thị)"@vi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Tác phẩm có chứa đánh giá vắn tắt về biểu thị đang được mô tả."@vi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "er manifestation anmeldt i"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaterer en manifestation til et værk, som indeholder en kort kritik af en manifestation."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "er manifestation anmeldt i"@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Værk, som indeholder en kort kritik af en manifestation."@da .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ist Manifestation rezensiert in"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Setzt eine Manifestation in Beziehung zu einem Werk, bei dem es sich um eine kurze Untersuchung einer Manifestation handelt."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "Manifestation rezensiert in"@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Ein Werk, bei dem es sich um eine kurze Untersuchung einer Manifestation handelt."@de .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "és manifestació revisada per"@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relaciona una manifestació amb una obra que és una avaluació breu d’una manifestació."@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "manifestació revisada per"@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Obra que és una avaluació breu d’una manifestació."@ca .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Liittää manifestaation teokseen, joka on lyhyt arvostelu manifestaatiosta."@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "manifestaation arvostelu"@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Teos, joka on lyhyt arvostelu manifestaatiosta."@fi .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "manifestasjon anmeldt i "@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Et verk som inneholder en kortfattet evaluering av en manifestasjon."@no .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "εξετάζεται στην (εκδήλωση)"@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Συνδέει μια εκδήλωση με ένα έργο που περιέχει μια σύντομη αξιολόγηση μιας περιγραφόμενης εκδήλωσης."@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "εξετάζεται στην (εκδήλωση)"@el .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30259> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Ένα έργο που περιέχει μια σύντομη αξιολόγηση μιας περιγραφόμενης εκδήλωσης."@el .
