<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30279> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has place of manifestation"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30279> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/placeOfManifestation.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30279> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to a place that is associated with the distribution, printing, duplicating, casting, publication, release, or issuing of a published manifestation, or the inscription, fabrication, construction, or other method of production of an unpublished manifestation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30279> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10007> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30279> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "place of manifestation"@en .
