<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30075> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has platemaker agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30075> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to an agent who is responsible for preparing plates used in the making of printed images or text in a manifestation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30075> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
