<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30078> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has printer agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to an agent who is responsible for manufacturing a printed manifestation that embodies text, notated music, cartographic image, notated movement, or still image content using a device that transfers ink or a similar medium to a surface."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30078> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30078> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10007> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30078> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30082> .
