<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/m/P30006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to a designation for one or more regions of the world for which a videodisc or video game carrier has been encoded, indicating that playback is restricted to a device configured to decode it."@en .
